<title>NETHERLANDS: Vendex sells stake in Barnes &amp; Noble.</title>
<headline>Vendex sells stake in Barnes &amp; Noble.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch Retail and business services group Vendex International NV said on Thursday it had sold it entire remaining interest of around 1.8 million shares in Barnes &amp; Noble at a price of $34.25 per share.</p>
<p>The transaction will generate over 113 million guilders in cash, Vendex said, a book profit of 79 million guilders.</p>
</text>
